  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Full Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A creamy pencil in true-to-life shades that glides without tugging to accentuate your lip shape with precise application and a hydrated finish.</p><p><strong><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Liner</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Carnauba and Candelilla Wax Blend: Creates a creamy, comfortable texture that melts onto lips.</p><p>- Jojoba Seed Oil: Boosts moisture for a smooth application without tugging or skipping.</p><p>- Micronized Pigment: Delivers precise, lasting color payoff.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is gluten-free and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Choose a shade that resembles your own lip tone. <br>-Trace along your natural lip shape, accentuating where needed.<br>-Use your finger or Westman Atelier Lip Brush (sold separately) to blend and diffuse any harsh lines.<br>-Fill in and finish your lip look with a lipstick or lip gloss of your choice. Westman Atelier suggests Lip Suede Matte Lipstick or Squeaky Clean Liquid Lip Balm (each sold separately).</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Carnauba and Candelilla Wax Blend: Creates a creamy, comfortable texture that melts onto lips.<br>-Jojoba Seed Oil: Boosts moisture for a smooth application without tugging or skipping.<br>-Micronized Pigment: Delivers precise, lasting color payoff.<br><br>Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Cera Carnauba/Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax/Cire de Carnauba, Dextrin Isostearate, Squalane, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Dicalcium Phosphate, Candelilla Cera/Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax, Castor Isostearate Succinate, Mica, Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Calcium Silicate, Tocopherol, May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/): Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, 77492, 77499), Red 6 (CI 15850), Red 7 Lake (CI 15850).<br><br>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Full Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A creamy pencil in true-to-life shades that glides without tugging to accentuate your lip shape with precise application and a hydrated finish.</p><p><strong><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Liner</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Carnauba and Candelilla Wax Blend: Creates a creamy, comfortable texture that melts onto lips.</p><p>- Jojoba Seed Oil: Boosts moisture for a smooth application without tugging or skipping.</p><p>- Micronized Pigment: Delivers precise, lasting color payoff.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is gluten-free and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-g